= France falls to the hand of fascism.

Recently elected by bare majority **Popular Front** has attempted to launch committee at dealing with far right leagues and their terror. Unfortunately...

Group of far right leagues, including Action Française, Croix-de-Feu, Peasant Front, Solidarité Française, Mouvement Franciste, Jeunesses Patriotes and primarily **La Cagoule** have launched joint coup, supported by the anti communist right Republican Federation (RF). Coup had succeeded, taking down left wing government.

Void stares back...
